            <item identifier="1442092" identifierref="RES_CONTENT_1442092" d2l_2p0:id="26" d2l_2p0:resource_code="9366a937986a4dd98f348f96-44" description="&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA;&lt;head&gt;&#xA;&lt;/head&gt;&#xA;&lt;body style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-right: 0in; margin-left: 0in; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;When should leaders choose what is best for their nation over what is best for the world?&amp;nbsp; When the Tar Sands are a major contributor to global warming, should Alberta leaders choose jobs in Alberta or a healthier planet?&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;What gets more votes?&amp;nbsp; Who makes the money?&amp;nbsp; What are the motivations for these decisions?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-align: start; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-right: 0in; margin-left: 0in; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;And what happens when nationalism goes unchecked?&amp;nbsp; Ultranationalist&amp;nbsp;governments are on the rise around the world.&amp;nbsp; Can we look to the past to see what mistakes leaders made as ultranationalism&amp;nbsp;grew in Spain, Italy, Germany and much of Europe causing World War II and the Holocaust?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;315&quot; src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/6dj71ywmuOY?wmode=opaque&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allow=&quot;accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;" completion_type="2" d2l_2p0:ai_human_or